{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8fbb9bdb-0fda-8b05-afc6-c2dbc7757a6f",
  "created_at": "2026-01-28T16:53:13-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ellen Wilcox",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T16:48:17-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. Good afternoon, almost evening. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T16:48:24-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, hi. Um, I'm calling about a storm drain. On my street. It's, hmm, let me see, it's still backed up and the storm was Sunday into Monday, so it's been two days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T16:48:39-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, the snow turning to rain one. What's the address, or the nearest one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T16:48:46-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 6 Pelham Street. Up on the Historic Hill. The drain's right in front of my house, basically, a little down toward the corner. Well, no, it's more in front of the neighbor's, but it's the one that serves our stretch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T16:49:04-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 6 Pelham. And what's it doing? Is it blocked, is water sitting there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T16:49:11-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sitting there is generous. The street in front of the house turned into a pond. A real pond. Cars come through and they're throwing wakes, like actual waves, up toward people's front steps. I watched a delivery truck do it this morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T16:49:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's no good. Is it still that deep now, or has it gone down some?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T16:49:38-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm, it's gone down a little since the rain stopped, but it never really drains. It just kind of sits. And I did go out Monday and, um, pulled the leaves off the grate by hand. Wet leaves, all slimy, in my good gloves. And that helped, like, for ten minutes. Then it filled right back up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T16:50:03-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So you cleared the top, but it sounds like there's something further down the line, or it's packed in below the grate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T16:50:13-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, that's what I figured. Because the water was going down, I could hear it, and then it just stopped. So I'm asking, can somebody come out and clean the drain? Actually, not just look at it. Clean it. Get a truck or whatever it takes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T16:50:33-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'll put in a request for the drain to be cleaned. The crews have been slammed since that storm, so I can't tell you which day, but it goes on the list with your location."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T16:50:49-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I mean, fine. It's just, it's also making parking a nightmare. I'm circling, like, constantly. I got home at four and went around the block three times because nobody wants to park in the pond. Or I did park, and then, no, I moved the car because the water was coming up over the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T16:51:14-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I believe it. Everybody crowds onto the dry spots. Let me get a few details so the crew can find it. Is it on the right side or left side going up the hill?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T16:51:29-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm, let me see. If you're facing up the hill, it's on the, um, left. No, wait, right. I'm picturing my front door. Right. It's on the right side, at the low point where the curb dips."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T16:51:46-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right side at the low point, near 6 Pelham. Is there a catch basin with a grate in the street, or is it a drain in the gutter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T16:51:59-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A grate, in the gutter. Iron, rectangular. It's the only one on that block that I know of, which is probably the problem."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T16:52:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And do you want a call back, or just have it logged?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T16:52:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Logged is fine, but if they need to reach me it's 401-555-0191."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T16:52:22-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-one. Got it. I've noted the standing water, the leaves you cleared by hand, and that it filled back up. Name for the request?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T16:52:34-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ellen Wilcox. W-I-L-C-O-X."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T16:52:36-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Ellen. And if it freezes tonight with all that water out there, give us a call back, because ice on the road is a different priority."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T16:52:48-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, great, I hadn't even thought of that. Well, okay. Hopefully somebody gets here before that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T16:52:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We'll do what we can. Anything else I can help with this afternoon?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T16:53:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks. Please just, you know, get the truck out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T16:53:08-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I've got it down. Take care, Ellen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T16:53:12-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye."
    }
  ],
